############
# ptraker — Production Supabase Environment
# Jupiter VPS (142.202.190.9)
#
# SETUP:
#   1. Run the secret generation script (see below) on Jupiter to get all secrets at once
#   2. Copy this file to /data/supabase-ptraker/.env
#   3. Replace every <GENERATED> and <CHANGE_ME> value
#
